# layerive
===
 Layerive is a local AI image creation workspace that manages projects and version trees for text-to-image generation, prompt-based editing, inpainting and reference image blending, batch variation generation, batch text-to-image (with consistent style), text editing, outpainting, watermark removal, and complete conversation logs.
